    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n59432" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κουμᾶσι:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ τῶν ὀρνίθων οῐκημα</span>, <i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i>
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κούνημα:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόκων ἢ ὁ κύων</span>, Id. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κούνικλος</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
